### Medical Device Disclaimer
This software and associated neural network weights are developed and provided strictly for academic research, education, and exploratory clinical decision support (CDSS) triage evaluation. This software has NOT been approved as a certified medical device by the US FDA, European CE MDR, Indonesian BPOM, or other relevant health regulatory bodies. It is NOT intended to replace professional radiological judgment, tissue biopsy, or direct consultation with licensed medical practitioners.
